Definition of cloud computing.
From the microsoft learn portal, cloud computing is defined as network, compute and storage resources delivered over the internet.

Cloud computing changes the costs from Capex(Buying physical hardware) to OPex(Renting physical hardware or storage from the cloud service provider).

This means tenants only pay for the resources that they consume whuch cuts down costs. 

With this simple defenition of cloud computing comes responsibilities between the cloud service provider and the customer. 

We will cover this in depth in the cloud deployment and cloud service models.
